  "request": "Issue #381: 7bb4 [BUG] Safely remove worktrees with initialized submodules during worktree cleanup. Target finalize-cleanup in Spec-Driven Development worktree mode. Problem: git worktree remove fails for worktrees containing initialized submodules; current cleanup does not classify the submodule rejection and may leave worktree and branch. Improvement: try normal remove first; when failure is submodule-related, inspect dirty state of the worktree and submodules; run git worktree remove --force only when confirmed clean; if dirty or locked, keep the worktree and return recovery guidance.",
